### Is this suited for github?

- [x] Yes, this is suited for github

### Reproduction

In a new better-auth application developed with [better-auth-cloudflare](https://github.com/zpg6/better-auth-cloudflare), after updating to latest version of better-auth (1.6.9), potentially before updating, typescript suggestions for betterAuth({ ... }).api disappeared. `better-auth/plugins` `openAPI()` isn't compatible with the `betterAuth({ plugins })`.



### Current vs. Expected behavior

`betterAuth({ plugins: [] }).api` is type `any`. Helpful typing information and suggestions are missing.


### What version of Better Auth are you using?

1.6.9

